  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 69 - 23 + 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs :\n\nOption 1) × and -\n\n69 - 23 + 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114 ⇒ 69 × 23 + 15 ÷ 11 - 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 69 × 23 + __**15 ÷ 11**__ - 12 = -114\n\n⇒ __**69 ×**____** 23**__ + 1.36 - 12 = -114\n\n⇒ **__1587__**__** + 1.36**__ - 12 = -114\n\n⇒ __**1588.36 - 12**__ = -114\n\n⇒ 1575.36 ≠ -114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) - and ÷\n\n69 - 23 + 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114 ⇒ 69 ÷ 23 + 15 - 11 × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ __**69 ÷**____** 23**__ + 15 - 11 × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 3 + 15 - __**11 × 12**__ = -114\n\n⇒ __**3**____** + 15**__ - 132 = -114\n\n⇒ **__18__**__** - 132**__ = -114\n\n⇒ -114 = -114 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) - and +\n\n69 - 23 + 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114 ⇒ 69 + 23 - 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 69 + 23 - __**15 ÷ 11**__ × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 69 + 23 - __**1.36 × 12**__ = -114\n\n⇒ __**69 + 23**__ - 16.32 = -114\n\n⇒ __92** - 16.32**__ = -114\n\n⇒ 75.68 ≠ -114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\n69 - 23 + 15 ÷ 11 × 12 = -114 ⇒ 69 - 23 ÷ 15 + 11 × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 69 - __**23 **____**÷**____** 15**__ + 11 × 12 = -114\n\n⇒ 69 - 4.6 + __**11 × 12**__ = -114\n\n⇒ __**69 + 132**__ - 4.6 = -114\n\n⇒ __201____** - 4.6**__ = -114\n\n⇒ 196.4 ≠ -114 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
